feat(compiler): add effect annotations and checking
scale: ~579 lines across 12 files [L]

- `crates/vox-compiler/src/typeck/effect_check.rs`: New file implementing effect propagation checks for annotated functions. It verifies that a caller's declared capabilities (via `uses` clause or `@pure`) are a superset of its callees' effective capabilities.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/parser/descent/decl/head.rs`: Added parsing logic for the `uses <effect-list>` clause in function signatures, supporting `net`, `db`, `fs`, `env`, `clock`, `random`, `spawn`, `nothing`, and `mcp(<tool-name>)` effects.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/ast/decl/effect.rs`: New file defining the `EffectAnnotation` enum for AST representation of effect annotations.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/parser/descent/tests.rs`: Added new test cases for parsing `uses nothing`, `uses net`, `uses net, db`, and `uses mcp(tool_name)` clauses.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/hir/nodes/decl.rs`: Added `capabilities: Vec<HirCapability>` field to `HirFn` and introduced the `HirCapability` enum to represent lowered effect annotations.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/hir/lower/decl.rs`: Implemented lowering of `ast::EffectAnnotation` to `hir::HirCapability` during function declaration processing.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/typeck/mod.rs`: Integrated the new `effect_check` module into the type checker.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/ast/decl/fundecl.rs`: Added `effects: Vec<EffectAnnotation>` field to `FunDecl` struct.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/ast/decl/mod.rs`: Exported the new `effect` module.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/typeck/diagnostics.rs`: Added `EffectMismatch` diagnostic category.
